1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,159
Hello everyone. I'm Jake Stevens

2
00:00:03,159 --> 00:00:10,830
and I'm your rep here at the hotel I'm sure you'll all have a great time here.

3
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:14,875
So let me tell you a bit about what's on offer.

4
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:20,390
I'll start by telling you about some of the excursions that are available for guests.

5
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:25,470
One thing you have to do while you're here is go dolphin watching.

6
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:30,055
On our boat trips, we pretty well guarantee you'll see dolphins -

7
00:00:30,055 --> 00:00:34,640
if you don't you can repeat the trip free of charge.

8
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:38,211
We organise daily trips for just 35 euros.

9
00:00:38,211 --> 00:00:42,674
Unfortunately there aren't any places left for this afternoon's trip,

10
00:00:42,674 --> 00:00:48,030
but come and see me to book for later in the week.

11
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:52,820
If you're energetic, I'd recommend our forest walk

12
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,990
It's a guided walk of about seven kilometres.

13
00:00:56,990 --> 00:01:03,260
There'll be a stop half way, and you'll be provided with a drink and sandwiches.

14
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:06,848
There's some fairly steep climbs up the hills,

15
00:01:06,848 --> 00:01:11,807
so you need to be reasonably fit for this one with good shoes,

16
00:01:12,430 --> 00:01:16,265
and bring a waterproof in case it rains

17
00:01:16,265 --> 00:01:20,750
It's just 25 euros all inclusive, and it's every Wednesday.

18
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:25,340
Then on Thursdays we organise a cycle trip

19
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:29,470
which will give you all the fun of biking without the effort.

20
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:35,206
We'll take you and your bike up to the top of Mount Larna,

21
00:01:35,206 --> 00:01:41,384
and leave you to bike back - it's a 700-metre drop in just 20 kilometres

22
00:01:41,384 --> 00:01:47,120
so this isn't really for inexperienced cyclists as you'll be going pretty fast.

23
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:52,140
And if it's a clear day, you'll have fantastic views.

24
00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:55,240
On our local craft tour

25
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:59,310
you can find out about the traditional activities in the island.

26
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:04,594
And the best thing about this trip is that it's completely free.

27
00:02:04,594 --> 00:02:11,200
You'll be taken to a factory where jewellery is made, and also a ceramics centre.

28
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:17,909
If you want, you can buy some of the products but that's entirely up to you.

29
00:02:17,909 --> 00:02:23,360
The trip starts after lunch on Thursday, and you'll return by 6 pm.

30
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:26,360
If you're interested in astronomy

31
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:32,710
you may already know that the island's one of the best places in the world to observe the night sky.

32
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:38,370
We can offer trips to the observatory on Friday for those who are interested.

33
00:02:38,370 --> 00:02:44,680
They cost 90 euros per person and you'll be shown the huge telescopes

34
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,822
and have a talk from an expert,

35
00:02:46,822 --> 00:02:49,780
who'll explain all about how they work.

36
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:52,217
Afterwards well head down to Sunset Beach,

37
00:02:52,217 --> 00:02:55,780
where you can have a dip in the ocean

38
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:59,180
if you want before we head off back to the hotel.

39
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:02,610
Finally, there's horse riding.

40
00:03:02,610 --> 00:03:06,941
This is organised by the Equestrian Centre over near Playa Cortino

41
00:03:06,941 --> 00:03:11,980
and it's a great experience if you're a keen horseback rider

42
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:15,210
or even if you've never been on a horse before.

43
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:18,020
They take you down to the beach

44
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:23,330
and you can canter along the sand and through the waves.

45
00:03:23,330 --> 00:03:27,390
It costs 35 euros and it's available every day.

46
00:03:27,390 --> 00:03:34,590
So there's plenty to do in the daytime, but what about night life?

47
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:40,250
Well, the number one attractions called 'Musical Favourites'.

48
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:45,340
Guests enjoy a three-course meal and unlimited free drinks

49
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:47,367
and watch a fantastic show,

50
00:03:47,367 --> 00:03:51,280
starting with musicals set in Paris and

51
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:56,010
then crossing the Atlantic to Las Vegas and finally Copacabana.

52
00:03:56,010 --> 00:04:00,177
At the end the cast members come down from the stage,

53
00:04:00,177 --> 00:04:05,480
still in their stunning costumes, and you'll have a chance to chat with them.

54
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:10,215
It's hugely popular, so let me know now if you're interested

55
00:04:10,215 --> 00:04:14,520
because it's no good leaving it until the last minute.

56
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:18,836
It's on Friday night. Tickets are just 50 euros each,

57
00:04:18,836 --> 00:04:25,310
but for an extra 10 euros you can have a table right by the stage.

58
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:31,720
If you'd like to go back in time, there's the Castle Feast on Saturday evening.

59
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:34,511
It's held in a twelfth-century castle,

60
00:04:34,511 --> 00:04:41,490
and you eat in the great courtyard, with ladies in long gowns serving your food.

61
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:46,960
You're given a whole chicken each, which you eat in the medieval way

62
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:49,808
using your hands instead of cutlery,

63
00:04:49,808 --> 00:04:52,620
and you're entertained by competitions

64
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:57,250
where the horseback riders attempt to knock one another off their horses.

65
00:04:57,250 --> 00:05:00,821
Then you can watch the dancers in the ballroom

66
00:05:00,861 --> 00:05:06,740
and join in as well if you want. OK, so now if anyone
